  "abstract": "<jats:p>We developed a next-generation InP twin-IQ modulator PIC for beyond 200-Gbaud operations. A 3-dB electro-optic bandwidth of the modulator exceeds 100 GHz while maintaining a half-wave voltage of 1.5 V and total on-chip optical insertion loss of less than 3.5 dB.</jats:p>",
